This repository is a derivative work.

It adapts the Transformer Latent Diffusion codebase
    https://github.com/apapiu/transformer_latent_diffusion
    Copyright (c) 2023 Alexandru Papiu
    MIT License
from text-to-image latent diffusion to a 1D conditional diffusion model for the
numerical analytic continuation of imaginary-time correlation functions, as
described in:

    Sagi Meir, Daniel Freedman, and Barak Hirshberg,
    "Using Diffusion Models to Estimate Uncertainties in Analytic Continuation."

New and modified code for the analytic-continuation adaptation is
    Copyright (c) 2026 Sagi Meir, Daniel Freedman, and Barak Hirshberg
and is released under the same MIT License (see the LICENSE file).

The transformer building blocks of the original project were in turn inspired by
PixArt-alpha, k-diffusion, nanoGPT, and LocalViT; see the upstream repository for
those acknowledgments.
